{"3804950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FPV Kamikaze Drone Simulator", "steam_appid": 3804950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/3ba1460c738ce9269033d63c2af0fea4.poster.avif?t=1778772752\" width=615 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/3ba1460c738ce9269033d63c2af0fea4.webm?t=1778772752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Experience the adrenaline-fueled intensity of modern drone warfare like never before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FPV Kamikaze Drone Simulator</i> is a high-octane action game that puts you in direct control of cutting-edge FPV drones on deadly kamikaze missions. Navigate realistic battlefields, outmaneuver enemy defenses, and strike high-value targets with surgical precision. Whether you're an action junkie or a fan of flight simulators, this game delivers a fresh, immersive perspective on tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/ad18e474a3a0f727066949607c856355.poster.avif?t=1778772752\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/ad18e474a3a0f727066949607c856355.webm?t=1778772752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/ad18e474a3a0f727066949607c856355.mp4?t=1778772752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the controls of anti-tank kamikaze drones, perform top-down grenade strikes, and fly night missions using infrared and night vision tech. Every mission challenges your reflexes, tactics, and decision-making as you engage enemy infantry, tanks, artillery, and fortified bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Early Access version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ 5 combat maps + a dedicated training zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Anti-tank kamikaze and grenade-drop drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Night vision and infrared camera support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Day/night missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Realistic flight &amp; explosion physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Enemy tanks, IFVs, artillery, and infantry</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re just getting started. Upcoming updates will bring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚁 New drone types with unique capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦 Dynamic weather systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 Smarter enemy AI and more complex missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Building and vehicle destruction systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Community-suggested content</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built With Realism in Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game — it’s a simulation grounded in real-world tech. We aim to create the most authentic FPV drone warfare experience available, and community feedback is a vital part of that journey. Expect regular updates, surveys, and open discussion with the developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! I’m an indie developer from the Kyrgyz Republic. Many players ask where I’m from, so here it is. This game is a <strong>neutral project</strong> — it does not support <strong>any side in current military conflicts</strong> (e.g., Russia-Ukraine, Israel-Palestine). My goal is to build a realistic simulator that explores the capabilities of modern drones without taking political stances.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/3ba1460c738ce9269033d63c2af0fea4.poster.avif?t=1778772752\" width=615 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/3ba1460c738ce9269033d63c2af0fea4.webm?t=1778772752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Experience the adrenaline-fueled intensity of modern drone warfare like never before.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>FPV Kamikaze Drone Simulator</i> is a high-octane action game that puts you in direct control of cutting-edge FPV drones on deadly kamikaze missions. Navigate realistic battlefields, outmaneuver enemy defenses, and strike high-value targets with surgical precision. Whether you're an action junkie or a fan of flight simulators, this game delivers a fresh, immersive perspective on tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/ad18e474a3a0f727066949607c856355.poster.avif?t=1778772752\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/ad18e474a3a0f727066949607c856355.webm?t=1778772752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/extras/ad18e474a3a0f727066949607c856355.mp4?t=1778772752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the controls of anti-tank kamikaze drones, perform top-down grenade strikes, and fly night missions using infrared and night vision tech. Every mission challenges your reflexes, tactics, and decision-making as you engage enemy infantry, tanks, artillery, and fortified bases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Early Access version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ 5 combat maps + a dedicated training zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Anti-tank kamikaze and grenade-drop drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Night vision and infrared camera support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Day/night missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Realistic flight &amp; explosion physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ Enemy tanks, IFVs, artillery, and infantry</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re just getting started. Upcoming updates will bring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚁 New drone types with unique capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦 Dynamic weather systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 Smarter enemy AI and more complex missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Building and vehicle destruction systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Community-suggested content</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built With Realism in Mind</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a game — it’s a simulation grounded in real-world tech. We aim to create the most authentic FPV drone warfare experience available, and community feedback is a vital part of that journey. Expect regular updates, surveys, and open discussion with the developer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Note from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! I’m an indie developer from the Kyrgyz Republic. Many players ask where I’m from, so here it is. This game is a <strong>neutral project</strong> — it does not support <strong>any side in current military conflicts</strong> (e.g., Russia-Ukraine, Israel-Palestine). My goal is to build a realistic simulator that explores the capabilities of modern drones without taking political stances.</p>", "short_description": "An intense FPV drone warfare simulator with online multiplayer and co-op modes. Take control of modern kamikaze drones in a high-adrenaline combat experience where precision, speed, and tactics decide your success. Play solo or team up with friends to destroy enemy tanks, vehicles, and bases.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/db15ddbbf5aa0924593f3d4f0655b3b52c0645e1/header.jpg?t=1778772752", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/92052781222bf9619f89bba77ace76774e5e5ca6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778772752", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804950/92052781222bf9619f89bba77ace76774e5e5ca6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778772752", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 8.1, Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> RC transmitter is recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<b